    <string name="webview_limitations_title">Android WebView Architecture &amp; Technical Transparency</string>
    <string name="webview_limitation_notifications">Android system WebView does not include Google Cloud Messaging / FCM ServiceWorker Push endpoints. LiteSpace implements (1) a W3C Notification JS API bridge for active/foreground pages and (2) a WorkManager Atom/RSS/JSON page monitor for background notifications.</string>
    <string name="webview_limitation_isolation">On Android 8–9 (API 26–28), WebView shares a process-wide CookieManager store. LiteSpace snapshots, clears, and restores per-app cookies and origin storage when switching between Lite App profiles, and uses AndroidX WebKit Profile partitioning where supported on newer Android versions.</string>
